Win Win is a drama, comedy film directed by Tom McCarthy.

3
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:46,000
When down-on-his-luck part-time high school wrestling coach Mike agrees to become legal guardian to an elderly man, his ward's
troubled grandson turns out to be a star grappler, sparking dreams of a big win -- until the boy's mother retrieves him.

